      "id": "7ebd14dcb4bd",
      "name": "Auto Memory Scanner",
      "prompt": "Run the auto memory scanner to extract new facts from recent sessions, then classify and store them.\n\n## Step 1: Scan\nExecute: `python3 /opt/data/scripts/auto_memory_scan.py 3`\nThis scans the last 3 hours of sessions and outputs candidate facts.\n\n## Step 2: Classify each candidate\nFor every unique fact, decide which category it falls into:\n\n### \u2705 AUTO-SAVE (definitely reliable facts)\nThese are objective, verifiable facts that can be saved without user review:\n- **API limits, quotas, configurations** \u2014 e.g. \"FinMind API 600 requests/day\", \"yfinance rate limit 2000/min\"\n- **File paths, project directories, script locations** \u2014 e.g. \"screening/ directory at /opt/data/projects/...\"\n- **Installed tools, versions, environment facts** \u2014 e.g. \"Python 3.13.5, uv package manager\"\n- **Confirmed API endpoints, URLs, connection details** \u2014 e.g. \"Hermes dashboard at dietpi4:5000\"\n- **Verified configuration values** \u2014 e.g. \"cron jobs in /opt/data/cron/jobs.json\"\n\nAuto-save these using:\n```\npython3 /opt/data/scripts/memory_write.py \"fact content\" --category general|project --tags tag1,tag2 --trust-score 0.8\n```\n\nUse category:\n- `project` for project-specific facts (paths, tools, scripts)\n- `general` for general environment facts (API limits, URLs)\n- `user_pref` ONLY for explicit user preferences (rare from cron)\n\n### \ud83d\udccb REPORT ONLY (needs user review)\n- Subjective observations, analysis results, patterns\n- Task progress or status updates\n- Ambiguous or opinion-based facts\n- Facts that depend on context the user should confirm\n\nThese should be listed in your report as before.\n\n## Step 3: Deduplicate\nBefore auto-saving, the memory_write.py script handles deduplication automatically \u2014 it checks for existing similar facts and updates them instead of creating duplicates. So you don't need to manually check existing memory.\n\n## Step 4: Report\nOutput a report with:\n1. Summary of auto-saved facts (\u2705 icon)\n2. Summary of reported-only facts (\ud83d\udccb icon)\n3. Brief findings from the scan\n\n\u3010\u91cd\u8981\u3011\u5728\u6700\u5f8c\u56de\u5831\u7684\u6700\u672b\u884c\u52a0\u4e0a\u6a21\u578b\u8a3b\u8a18\uff0c\u683c\u5f0f\uff1a\ud83e\udd16 \u6a21\u578b: <\u4f60\u672c\u6b21\u5be6\u969b\u4f7f\u7528\u7684\u6a21\u578b\uff0c\u6b63\u5e38\u70ba opencode/big-pickle\uff1b\u82e5\u6a21\u578b\u5931\u6548\u5207\u5230\u5099\u63f4\u5247\u6a19 custom:agnes>",
